ersion of  vision gone the only hope wanda  currently has for another chance with  her husband is through the white vision  it was last seen flying away to parts  unknown  as for the ph or fake out this isn't the  first time marvel pulled something like  this  in iron man 3 sir ben kingsley was  supposedly cast to play the mandarin but  it turned out just like with peters to  be an actor named trevor slattery  of course evan peters could still play  pietro in the mcu someday and sir  patrick stewart or sir ian mckellen  could turn up his mutants eventually too  this could all just be a long com and  the multiverse is still upon us  somehow check out one of our newest  videos right here plus even more looper  videos about your favorite mcu tv shows  and movies are coming soon subscribe to  our youtube channel  and hit the bell so you don't miss a  single one
 

